WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.820
- [Kelly Clarkson] So everyone
also knows you as Shorty,

00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:03.980
from Indiana Jones as well,
which you've been in such

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:06.320
epic films, like right off
the bat, at such a young age.

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:08.323
So, do you remember working
with Harrison Ford? Or?

00:00:08.323 --> 00:00:10.970
- [Ke Huy Quan] Yeah! Oh
my God, it was incredible!

00:00:10.970 --> 00:00:12.420
- [Kelly Clarkson] You've
worked with some awesome people,

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:13.253
right off the bat!

00:00:13.253 --> 00:00:15.510
- [Ke Huy Quan] Well, yeah,
first time ever, right?

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:17.490
Yeah, he was incredible,
he was like one of the most

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:21.220
generous, down to earth
human beings I've ever met.

00:00:21.220 --> 00:00:23.930
And I remember we shot a
lot of the exterior stuff

00:00:23.930 --> 00:00:27.040
in Sri Lanka and we all
stayed in this hotel.

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:29.820
And every day after we wrapped,
we would go and hang out

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:31.260
at the swimming pool.

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:33.550
And when Harrison Ford found
out that I didn't know how

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:36.110
to swim, he says, Keith,
come on, let me teach you.

00:00:36.110 --> 00:00:39.110
So to this day, I learned how
to swim, it's because of him.

00:00:39.110 --> 00:00:42.620
- [Kelly Clarkson] Harrison
Ford taught you how to swim?

00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:43.520
What is your life?

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:49.187
All I had a swim instructor
at the Y or something like,

00:00:49.187 --> 00:00:52.160
you know, and I was like,
wait, what? That's crazy.

00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:54.840
I love that that because it's
not always that way for kids,

00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:55.700
like starting out.

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:57.770
Like, I love that that was
such a positive experience,

00:00:57.770 --> 00:00:59.470
right off the bat, that's so cool.

00:00:59.470 --> 00:01:00.620
- [Ke Huy Quan] I got
really lucky, I mean,

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:02.030
who would've thought, right?

00:01:02.030 --> 00:01:03.070
I mean, get to work with,

00:01:03.070 --> 00:01:04.913
I mean, Steven Spielberg, George Lucas

00:01:04.913 --> 00:01:06.295
and Harrison Ford?

00:01:06.295 --> 00:01:08.453
- [Kelly Clarkson] (laughs)
Right off the bat, yeah!

